{"title":"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The operation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/8/b88c462e5d9319a7d2181ad94863658fa0a24736.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\otimes$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"12\" /> is defined for all nonzero numbers by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/9/429a28a36c2ef2bcfcd5ca7e29fccf8b16b8dcf8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\otimes b =\\frac{a^{2}}{b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"83\" height=\"39\" />. Determine <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/c/f9cbc296f6d18eac4c7b30b42a83fc69c6e32162.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[(1\\otimes 2)\\otimes 3]-[1\\otimes (2\\otimes 3)]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"212\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/9/229b35a3262147d8553132cb6f9187c255289fdd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ -\\frac{2}{3}\\qquad\\text{(B)}\\ -\\frac{1}{4}\\qquad\\text{(C)}\\ 0\\qquad\\text{(D)}\\ \\frac{1}{4}\\qquad\\text{(E)}\\ \\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"389\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Follow PE(MD)(AS), doing the innermost parentheses first.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/c/f9cbc296f6d18eac4c7b30b42a83fc69c6e32162.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[(1\\otimes 2)\\otimes 3]-[1\\otimes (2\\otimes 3)]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"212\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/3/1c3b42cf303113f7704e69ad5ed83130da3e39ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[\\frac{1^2}{2}\\otimes 3]-[1\\otimes \\frac{2^2}{3}]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"144\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/b/9abcf9d98488337d87742f88597a37a35779e639.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[\\frac{1}{2}\\otimes 3]-[1\\otimes \\frac{4}{3}]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"129\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/b/d6bb554c3c21ca52249177ed3a59ff64a167f3ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[\\frac{(\\frac{1}{2})^{2}}{3}]-[\\frac{1^2}{(\\frac{4}{3})}]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"105\" height=\"47\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/3/47306518909ceea5ecfd7e3f14b6b81726c8ec6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[\\frac{1}{4} \\cdot \\frac{1}{3}]-[\\frac{3}{4}]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"92\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/d/fcd2a93b4b666b59883420638340e4917e1ec5be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{12} - \\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"56\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/a/e3a21f500861bf62badc74d29c61f3ae64735b06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{12} - \\frac{9}{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"65\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/d/2bd16d6e40d5b723b7232a1f53cd642ea6c9ba14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-8}{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"25\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/f/1efac12079e5b21957c06321b7b6526ad85c13d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"29\" height=\"38\" />, which is answer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/e/f6eb65962292d994ce2f9a8af63728883f256b18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"27\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dJmKnoKqjX4\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dJmKnoKqjX4</a>    ~David\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;sectio